    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/24a7979e-8596-4e05-a78f-569d372f2f6b-image19.png\"/> <br/>Path difference at <math><mi>“</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>”</mi></math> , <math><mo>∆</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math> <br/><math><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>α</mi><mo>:</mo><mi> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>≅</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></math> and <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mrow></math> <br/><math><mo>⇒</mo><mo>∆</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi> </mi><mo>∆</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.36</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>180</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>600</mn><mi> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> <br/><math><mn>600</mn><mi> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>λ</mi></math> <br/><math><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> <br/>Constructive interference <math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is incorrect <br/><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> Fringe width does not depend on <math><mi>α</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is incorrect <br/><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi> </mi><mo>∆</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mi> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.36</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>180</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.3</mn><mi> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>11</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>39</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> <br/>Now, <math><mo>∆</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>39</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>600</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math> <br/>Destructive interference happened <math><mo>⇒</mo></math> correct <br/><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi> </mi><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>∴</mo><mo>∆</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>33</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math> <br/><math><mo>∆</mo><mi>x</mi></math> in terms of <math><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>33</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>600</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/>as <math><mo>∆</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/>There will be destructive interference. <math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is incorrect.",
